{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"I found two concrete gaps: a symlink in a parent directory can escape the static asset root, and the vendored Datastar client’s default retry policy does not reconnect after a clean subscription close. The reconnect test opens a new socket itself, so it does not verify the browser behavior claimed in the README."}}
